        "created_at": "2012-09-20T18:13:18.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Seige-Breaker is an&nbsp;excellent&nbsp;name for Bunker's nemesis.&nbsp; The guy on the card (Polyphoric Flare, if I'm not mistaken) looks like he's wearing some sort of suit, which makes sense.&nbsp; However, if the guy on the card is this Seige-Breaker, he doesn't quite have&nbsp;that&nbsp;villainous edge to his appearance.&nbsp; Maybe a lieutenant or something, though.&nbsp; (No offense if that's somebody's picture.&nbsp;  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=9\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\"> )</p>",
